WEBVTT

00:01:00.660 --> 00:01:02.030
You shouldn't swim.

00:01:02.630 --> 00:01:06.530
But it's a nice feeling for my bones.

00:01:24.920 --> 00:01:28.290
Hey! Ugly, perv-skeleton! Would you tell me what the hell...

00:01:30.560 --> 00:01:33.020
you think you're looking at, you bastard!?

00:01:36.730 --> 00:01:38.360
It's a joy for the eyes!

00:01:38.360 --> 00:01:41.000
Even though you don't have eyes! I've got you!

00:01:43.070 --> 00:01:44.040
What a beautiful day!

00:02:06.660 --> 00:02:07.730
Something appeared!

00:02:12.060 --> 00:02:13.370
Oh my, how cute!

00:02:16.100 --> 00:02:17.070
Is it a horse?

00:02:17.670 --> 00:02:18.670
A horse...?

00:02:21.910 --> 00:02:23.270
Where did it come from?

00:02:24.410 --> 00:02:27.910
Hold on, Nami-san! I'll drown if you continue! I'm scared! No, I'm happy!

00:02:29.480 --> 00:02:33.020
Quick, do something! Think of something!

00:02:35.090 --> 00:02:36.760
Don't you think it's similar to a cow?

00:02:36.760 --> 00:02:39.390
Luffy, don't let it escape! I'll make horse soup for dinner!

00:02:40.090 --> 00:02:41.860
Soup? Sounds tasty...

00:02:42.260 --> 00:02:45.060
I knew the New World was going to be completely different!

00:02:45.060 --> 00:02:46.030
There're full of unique ingredients here.

00:02:46.330 --> 00:02:47.530
Let me take care of it!

00:02:50.840 --> 00:02:55.510
Rubber... Jet Bazooka!!

00:03:03.750 --> 00:03:04.750
You had enough?

00:03:04.750 --> 00:03:05.850
You moron!

00:03:05.850 --> 00:03:08.120
Oh right! The meat!

00:03:18.330 --> 00:03:20.300
Now the booze will have to wait.

00:03:20.300 --> 00:03:21.600
We must find it!

00:03:23.170 --> 00:03:24.440
So scary!

00:03:24.440 --> 00:03:26.710
Brook, stay with us!

00:03:26.710 --> 00:03:29.770
Anyway, why did his body inflate so much?

00:03:29.770 --> 00:03:30.810
He's really unique.

00:03:34.980 --> 00:03:36.450
There it is!

00:03:39.050 --> 00:03:41.620
What a relief! Horse soup tonight!

00:03:41.620 --> 00:03:44.220
I can't wait to try it!

00:03:44.220 --> 00:03:47.190
Don't forget about the booze. A good one.

00:03:47.460 --> 00:03:49.130
You can't think about anything but booze.

00:03:50.330 --> 00:03:53.000
The New World is filled with different routes,

00:03:53.000 --> 00:03:56.570
we don't know if there's going to be a town on the next island, you have to stay sharp!

00:03:56.570 --> 00:03:58.900
I can take care of myself! You're the one who's risking your life!

00:03:59.400 --> 00:04:03.110
We can't risk the annihilation of the whole crew because you're completely drunk!

00:04:03.580 --> 00:04:06.640
Why don't you think about getting that meat from the seahorse instead?

00:04:06.640 --> 00:04:08.810
Without booze I can't concentrate!

00:04:08.810 --> 00:04:11.380
Now, now, calm down Zorosuke.

00:04:11.620 --> 00:04:12.420
Zorosuke?

00:04:12.420 --> 00:04:15.090
To me you seem like a pure-hearted guy!

00:04:15.090 --> 00:04:16.650
What the hell are you prattling about?!

00:04:16.650 --> 00:04:22.330
We have enough meat, don't we? Even without booze, we can still party!

00:04:22.530 --> 00:04:25.030
Even without flowers, petals might rain down!

00:04:25.430 --> 00:04:26.700
A rain of petals?

00:04:28.000 --> 00:04:33.240
Wouldn't you like to eat horse meat under a rain of cherry petals?

00:04:45.050 --> 00:04:46.620
May I ask you something, Nami?

00:04:47.020 --> 00:04:49.650
Hm? Something wrong, Chopper?

00:04:49.650 --> 00:04:51.790
I'm a little busy at the moment... what's up?

00:04:51.790 --> 00:04:57.330
Actually I'm following a milk diet lately... what's your opinion on it?

00:04:57.630 --> 00:05:00.930
It won't open, give me a hand!

00:05:00.930 --> 00:05:02.270
What are you up to?

00:05:02.270 --> 00:05:05.070
The poolside has to be sheltered.

00:05:08.310 --> 00:05:09.840
This feels good.

00:05:14.980 --> 00:05:18.580
It's super good! I'm so happy!

00:05:19.780 --> 00:05:21.250
Do you want some?

00:05:21.250 --> 00:05:24.990
I'd prefer an orange juice instead!

00:05:26.220 --> 00:05:28.490
As you wish!

00:05:28.490 --> 00:05:30.930
I'll make gallons of orange juice for my Nami-san!

00:05:31.460 --> 00:05:33.730
Yes! With great pleasure!

00:05:34.670 --> 00:05:36.730
What are you talking about, Sanji?

00:05:36.730 --> 00:05:40.310
Idiot! Didn't you hear what Nami-san just said?

00:05:41.870 --> 00:05:46.710
But right now Nami is very far from here... I didn't hear anything!

00:05:46.710 --> 00:05:49.280
My ears heard her perfectly fine!

00:05:49.280 --> 00:05:52.150
I can hear Nami-san and Robin-chan from miles away!

00:05:52.850 --> 00:05:55.290
Huh? What are you doing?

00:05:55.590 --> 00:05:56.520
There's an awful stink!

00:05:57.490 --> 00:05:59.690
On the garden above parasites have appeared...

00:06:00.860 --> 00:06:02.590
I'm preparing a pesticide!

00:06:02.590 --> 00:06:06.000
Then do it outside! This is a kitchen!

00:06:08.470 --> 00:06:12.070
Robin-chan! Want to drink something?

00:06:12.670 --> 00:06:14.940
No, I'm fine. Thanks!

00:06:15.540 --> 00:06:18.980
Usopp... do you know where the sprinkler is?

00:06:20.280 --> 00:06:23.450
It's in Usopp's Factory! I've just modified it a little.

00:06:31.490 --> 00:06:33.520
It's very beautiful, Usopp!

00:06:33.520 --> 00:06:36.330
What's so great about it... Robin-chan?

00:06:36.330 --> 00:06:37.530
It's a zombie sprinkler!

00:06:37.800 --> 00:06:40.000
It was very fun making it!

00:06:41.500 --> 00:06:44.770
Really? I can't wait to use it then!

00:06:54.050 --> 00:06:55.080
A big buffet?

00:06:55.380 --> 00:06:56.850
That's right!

00:06:56.850 --> 00:06:59.520
Even if we don't have a thing, we can still party!

00:07:00.520 --> 00:07:01.590
What idiocy...

00:07:01.590 --> 00:07:03.890
Listen Zorosuke...

00:07:03.890 --> 00:07:05.220
Still with the "suke"?!

00:07:05.220 --> 00:07:06.420
Try imagining...

00:07:06.790 --> 00:07:14.000
that here we have tasty fries, a gigantic hamburger... and cola as well!

00:07:44.660 --> 00:07:45.700
Ah, everything was great!

00:07:47.100 --> 00:07:49.300
<i>Incredible!</i>

00:07:49.770 --> 00:07:51.370
It seemed like you were really enjoying it!

00:07:53.840 --> 00:07:54.670
Of course!

00:07:57.480 --> 00:08:01.780
Whoever has a pure heart, has a fervid imagination as well!

00:08:01.780 --> 00:08:07.950
Alright! Then I imagine I'm having the biggest dinosaur leg in the world!

00:08:09.590 --> 00:08:11.860
No... wait!

00:08:14.390 --> 00:08:16.630
Here are islands made of meat!

00:08:18.800 --> 00:08:20.160
How's this?!

00:08:22.730 --> 00:08:26.470
Yummy! This island is really good!

00:08:26.700 --> 00:08:29.010
A waterfall of booze... creating a river.

00:08:33.180 --> 00:08:35.780
<i>Fantastic! Cool!</i>

00:08:36.250 --> 00:08:37.780
There's lot of stuff!

00:08:38.020 --> 00:08:40.420
Good! They're almost here...

00:08:40.850 --> 00:08:45.590
a hamburger bigger than the previous... delicious fries and lots of great cola!

00:08:47.660 --> 00:08:49.860
Clouds of cotton candy and cow milk!

00:08:50.430 --> 00:08:51.100
I did it!

00:08:52.160 --> 00:08:53.200
Wooo!

00:08:53.660 --> 00:08:55.430
This is a dreamlike place!

00:09:06.310 --> 00:09:09.110
If... if this is a place where everything comes true...

00:09:09.580 --> 00:09:13.680
then I... I... I...

00:09:18.620 --> 00:09:21.460
Would you care to show me your panties?

00:09:21.660 --> 00:09:22.830
Come back to reality!

00:09:23.060 --> 00:09:24.260
This calls for a toast!

00:09:24.260 --> 00:09:25.700
<i>Yes!</i>

00:09:25.700 --> 00:09:26.900
I feel like I'm flying!

00:09:31.970 --> 00:09:35.110
Guys, pay attention! Real horse meat is coming!

00:09:36.440 --> 00:09:39.610
The real one!? I knew the real ones are always the best!

00:09:39.610 --> 00:09:41.080
Take, drink.

00:09:42.110 --> 00:09:43.050
Booze?

00:09:43.050 --> 00:09:44.180
One of the best!

00:09:44.180 --> 00:09:49.990
While eating and drinking, for you everything is the same! Don't harm a cook's pride! Idiot!

00:09:52.690 --> 00:09:54.260
I'm not complaining.

00:09:54.260 --> 00:09:57.030
Right! Prepare those cherry trees...

00:09:57.260 --> 00:09:59.800
and let's party eating horse meat under a rain of cherry petals!

00:09:59.800 --> 00:10:01.030
Let's do it!!

00:10:01.470 --> 00:10:05.540
Usopp! Quick! I'll teach you how to imagine stuff!

00:10:05.540 --> 00:10:11.510
This petals' shower is really beautiful, and look at this booze! Brook, bring the mugs!

00:10:11.940 --> 00:10:14.410
A rain of petals? With pleasure!

00:10:16.180 --> 00:10:19.080
Huh?! How did he make it?!

00:10:21.120 --> 00:10:23.290
From where do all this cherry petals come out?!

00:10:23.290 --> 00:10:26.190
How did those cherry trees end up on the Sunny?!

00:10:28.960 --> 00:10:30.260
When did it happen?

00:10:35.570 --> 00:10:37.000
Nami-san, sorry if I made you wait.

00:10:42.370 --> 00:10:43.710
Good, let's go!

00:10:46.280 --> 00:10:47.680
Amazing!

00:10:50.280 --> 00:10:56.490
Cherry trees. Booze. Cherry trees and booze. Booze! Booze! Booze! Let's drink some booze!
